            <p>When it comes to Cozumel excursions, Royal Caribbean has the best options, including snorkeling tours, beach breaks, and amazing adventures. The island is renowned for its coral reefs, and some of the most popular excursions revolve around snorkeling or scuba diving. Guests have the opportunity to explore underwater life at one of the clearest waters, which are ranked as some of the best in the Caribbean. </p>

            <p>Royal Caribbean Cozumel excursions can also be tours to the ancient ruins of the Mayans on the mainland, and eco parks. Even non-TUI passengers sailing with other cruise operators have the option to do something similar. Whether you want to hang out on a secluded beach or ride a zip-line, there are multiple options in Cozumel. </p>

